hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1679","Narrated to us Bundar, narrated to us Yahya, narrated to us Muhammad ibn 'Amr. And it was also narrated to us Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj, narrated to us Ibn Idris, narrated to us Muhammad ibn 'Amr, from Abu Salamah, from Abu Hurayrah, from the Prophet (ﷺ), who said:\n\n\Do not prevent the female servants of Allah from the mosques of Allah. Let them go out when they go out in a state of *tiflat*.\""\n\nCHAPTER:"""""
